    "display_name": "Take All the Paint",
    "project_template_level_name": "CSA U1L6-PainterPlus PBT_pilot_oo2025",
    "long_instructions": "Take all of the paint from a paint bucket as long as a <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">Painter</code> object is standing on one.\r\n\r\n✅ **TO DO:** Write the method <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">takeAllPaint()</code> and use it in The Neighborhood.\r\n\r\n1. In <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">PainterPlus.java</code>, write the method <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">takeAllPaint()</code> to have a <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">Painter</code> object take all of the paint from the paint bucket.\r\n\r\n2. In <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">NeighborhoodRunner.java</code>, use your <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">takeAllPaint()</code> method to navigate and paint a path to the house.\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color: #E0D1EC; border: 1px solid #9660bf; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 1.1em; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n💡 <strong>TIP:</strong> Check out the <strong>Help & Tips</strong> tab ⬆️ for help with writing a method or a <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">while</code> loop.\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n📝 **COMMENT:** Be sure to add comments to note what your code does.\r\n\r\n🖥️ **TEST:** Test your program to check if your code achieves the expected result.\r\n\r\n🎉 **RUN:** Run your program to see the result of your code!\r\n\r\n**Note**: Code that you have written previously for the <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">PainterPlus</code> class will be seen here.\r\n\r\n## 🎯 Goal\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/eada3fab28a27c9472d67a443649574c-image-1666027147493.gif)",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Write the method `takeAllPaint()` to take all of the paint from a paint bucket as long as a `Painter` object is standing on one.",
